tures, not SDK declarative-config parsing or logunit. Commit 1 removes both unused suite dependencies while retaining the bridge dependency. All 9 existing JMX unit tests and the Kotlin Gradle formatting check pass with the reduced dependencies.","commit":1,"disposition":"fixed","key":"inline:4244431982"}],"input_identity":{},"outcome":"fixes","request_digest":"1b017e9075730770427f73dc250e813bad7dce989762d50f772424ed4f79ed86","schema":2},"download_sha256":"9bbae3dda1bababaa7b06519ee6a253ec730d93b8ad29057c55fe0dfb71059f1","frozen_sha":"1d51e6f22c0471ea87f5b8667d6af56096d8ae80","pr":20513,"publication_eligible":false,"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","request_digest":"1b017e9075730770427f73dc250e813bad7dce989762d50f772424ed4f79ed86","request_id":"01c76418a522422587824cf8b351b9f1","run_attempt":1,"run_id":38199887705,"schema":2,"scope":"Structural/Git verification only. No target code or tests are executed.","server_artifact_digest":"sha256:9bbae3dda1bababaa7b06519ee6a253ec730d93b8ad29057c55fe0dfb71059f1","verification":"verified","verification_run":{"attempt":1,"id":38201347742},"workflow_revision":"ad6a64e8dc14135373bf97b7702ff40449bb2704"},"request":{"authorized_actor_id":218610,"baseline_review_ids":[5485370186,5486262074,5486278313],"budgets":{"max_iterations":5,"propagation_seconds":120,"retention_days":14,"worker_timeout_minutes":30},"commit_author":{"id":218610,"login":"trask"},"findings":[{"body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udfe2 Approval recommended\n\nRuntime behavior and migration coverage are coherent, with only minor dependency and internal-documentation cleanup remaining.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>1 open finding</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Low severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Remove unused declarative config and logunit test dependencies](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/pull/20513#discussion_r4244431982) \u00b7 New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Previously missed (1)</strong></summary>\n\nIn code that hasn't changed since last review\n\n<details>\n<summary><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Low severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> Update metadata guidance to remove obsolete JMX mappings</summary>\n\n`declarative-config-bridge/\u200bsrc/\u200bmain/\u200bjava/\u200bio/\u200bopentelemetry/\u200binstrumentation/\u200bconfig/\u200bbridge/\u200bConfigPropertiesBackedDeclarativeConfigProperties.java:86`\n\nRemoving the JMX compatibility mappings leaves `.github/agents/knowledge/metadata-yaml-format.md:170-172` listing both as current special mappings. Update that table so repository guidance does not continue to advertise the removed properties.\n</details>\n</details>\n\n\ud83e\udde0 **Review effort:** Balanced","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5486278313","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5486278313},{"body":"The removed declarative-config parsing and log assertions were the only users of `opentelemetry-sdk-extension-declarative-config` and `logunit-jul`, but both remain declared in `javaagent/build.gradle.kts`. Remove those now-unused test dependencies as part of this simplification.","comment_commit_id":"1d51e6f22c0471ea87f5b8667d6af56096d8ae80","comment_id":4244431982,"key":"inline:4244431982","kind":"inline","line":30,"original_commit_id":"1d51e6f22c0471ea87f5b8667d6af56096d8ae80","original_line":30,"path":"instrumentation/jmx-metrics/javaagent/src/unitTests/java/io/opentelemetry/javaagent/instrumentation/jmx/JmxMetricInsightInstallerTest.java","review_commit_id":"1d51e6f22c0471ea87f5b8667d6af56096d8ae80","review_id":5486278313,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-12T03:25:01Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"86b13279250d9367b104b7001daf9eadca23e4de1373c70dadcc20970286092f","id":4244431982,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-12T03:25:01Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86rUbgf"}],"frozen_at":1791775690,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-12T03:28:10Z","frozen_sha":"1d51e6f22c0471ea87f5b8667d6af56096d8ae80","head_ref":"copilot/group-9-jmx-configuration","head_repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","head_repo_id":210933087,"input_mode":"direct","launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":38199847934},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","metadata":{"body":"<!--\nCHANGELOG.md is generated from merged pull requests. Do not add an entry unless this PR introduces\na deprecation or breaking change.\n-->\n\nRelated to #20510 \u2014 JMX configuration group only.\n\nMakes JMX enablement use distribution instrumentation selectors unconditionally and removes the deprecated target-system compatibility path for 3.0.\n\n- **Configuration:** Remove `otel.jmx.enabled`, `otel.jmx.target.system`, and their declarative mappings and metadata.\n- **Preserved behavior:** Automatic stable metrics, experimental opt-in, JVM-rule exclusion, custom rule files, and metric include/exclude filters.\n- **Coverage and documentation:** Consolidate preview/legacy tests while retaining independent rule and configuration coverage; update usage documentation and breaking-change notes.\n\n**Migration:** Replace `otel.jmx.enabled` with `otel.instrumentation.jmx.enabled`. Remove target-system selection; opt in to unstable metrics by name:\n\n```properties\notel.instrumentation.jmx.enabled=true\notel.jmx.metrics.experimental.included=jetty.*,kafka.*\n```\n\nFor declarative enablement, replace `java.jmx.enabled` with `distribution.javaagent.instrumentation.enabled` / `disabled` selectors.\n\nNo changes to metric definitions, runtime telemetry, instrumentation naming, or shared preview helpers.","title":"Adopt 3.0 JMX configuration behavior"},"mode":"publish","pr":20513,"pr_author_id":198982749,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1791775693,"generation":1,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"9044be89bd3e474cacbc2a30e5499db2","profile":"git-candidate-v1","required_checks":[]},"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","repo_id":210933087,"request_id":"01c76418a522422587824cf8b351b9f1","schema":2,"source_private":false,"target_private":false,"workflow_ref":"review-loop-revisions/ad6a64e8dc14135373bf97b7702ff40449bb2704","workflow_revision":"ad6a64e8dc14135373bf97b7702ff40449bb2704"},"run":{"attempt":1,"conclusion":"success","id":38199887705,"url":"https://github.com/trask/copilot-workflows/actions/runs/38199887705"},"schema":2,"seen_findings":["924dd3e558b607bddb305b7b7563dbd3f1ce4795918e31b762d64cd516302c99"],"seen_inline_findings":["0a77476358f8f3eeb65fd475e4bae937fd18513869a418712d4ea15a650a9bc5"],"seen_missed_findings":["79eb706d12f0cf463d291182f1bd98df427b1d66a4b032b53f34577627eca15c"],"stage":"publication_intent","verification_run":{"attempt":1,"id":38201347742}}